<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Four miners die in Western Deep tremor.</title>
<headline>Four miners die in Western Deep tremor.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four miners were killed and another four admitted to hospital after a seismic event at Western Deep Levels Ltd on Monday, managers Anglo American Corp of South Africa said.</p>
<p>Anglo said in a statement one of the injured miners was in a critical condition.</p>
<p>The event measured 2.5 on the Richter Scale and occurred at about 0935 GMT at the East Shaft, the company said in a statement. --Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
